abstract: >-
  An open, reproducible and interpretable classifier for missense variants of
  uncertain significance in BRCA1/BRCA2. It combines a curated functional-domain
  map with zero-shot ESM-2 protein language-model scores under a strict
  anti-leakage validation protocol (position-blocked cross-validation and
  independent external cohorts), is statistically comparable to state-of-the-art
  predictors (AlphaMissense, REVEL, CADD), and calibrates its score to
  ACMG/AMP evidence strength (PP3/BP4).
